    "steam_appid": 3165420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165420/extras/02bfff5dea808e39a0d9026214af5781.avif?t=1729677627\" width=600 height=263 /></span><br><strong>It's the Night of the Curse</strong><br><br>Rita the Re-animator is conducting occult experiments to bring her father back to life. In the nearby small town, a rift is ripped in the Veil, flooding the streets with spooks and specters, witches and werewolves, mummies, dummies, big tiddy vamp mommies; pumpkinheads, walking deads, undead newlyweds; slasher killers, third rate fillers, and the evils of the Thrillers.<br>It's up to young October, foremost among trick-or-treaters, to blaze a path to the old Haunted House and put an end to the annual Curse.<br><br><strong>It's a Halloween Party!</strong><br><br>This game has 5 levels \u2013 but it has over 30 unique enemy types! Everyone is invited to this October celebration. So get the spooky electro-swing pumping, smack a plastic mask over your kisser, and get ready to bob for some god-damned apples as the <i>Vampire</i>, the <i>Mummy</i>, the <i>Monster</i>, his <i>Bride </i>or the elusive <i>Creature</i>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No saving or loading. Play through the game in one go! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 Halloween Monster Masks to pick up and wear, unlocking unique abilities.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30+ enemy types, including pumpkins, skeletons and many strange cameos from old movies. </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165420/extras/02bfff5dea808e39a0d9026214af5781.avif?t=1729677627\" width=600 height=263 /></span><br><strong>It's the Night of the Curse</strong><br><br>Rita the Re-animator is conducting occult experiments to bring her father back to life. In the nearby small town, a rift is ripped in the Veil, flooding the streets with spooks and specters, witches and werewolves, mummies, dummies, big tiddy vamp mommies; pumpkinheads, walking deads, undead newlyweds; slasher killers, third rate fillers, and the evils of the Thrillers.<br>It's up to young October, foremost among trick-or-treaters, to blaze a path to the old Haunted House and put an end to the annual Curse.<br><br><strong>It's a Halloween Party!</strong><br><br>This game has 5 levels \u2013 but it has over 30 unique enemy types! Everyone is invited to this October celebration. So get the spooky electro-swing pumping, smack a plastic mask over your kisser, and get ready to bob for some god-damned apples as the <i>Vampire</i>, the <i>Mummy</i>, the <i>Monster</i>, his <i>Bride </i>or the elusive <i>Creature</i>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No saving or loading. Play through the game in one go! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 Halloween Monster Masks to pick up and wear, unlocking unique abilities.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30+ enemy types, including pumpkins, skeletons and many strange cameos from old movies. </li></ul>",
